<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX index ends officially at 5,929.15 pt.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX index ends officially at 5,929.15 pt.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange ended officially at 5,929.15 points, down 49.71, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 2.35 billion forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
